description = "The planet as a fact of the fabric. The world takes globe semantics on a flat chunk grid: X wraps around the circumference, Z is latitude bounded by impassable polar ice, and players locate each other by latitude, longitude and altitude. Terrain is seed-deterministic, so only player edits are ever stored."
tags = ["world-system"]
